.. raw:: html

    <div class="sphx-glr-thumbcontainer" tooltip="plot_haldane_phase_transition exposes the Haldane model&#x27;s chiral edge states on a ribbon -- periodic in-plane, open along one crystallographic direction. That is the easiest cut to compute, but it leaves open whether the edge state depends on cutting along a lattice direction the way graphene&#x27;s zigzag zero modes do (plot_graphene_zigzag_flake). It does not: a nonzero Chern number guarantees a chiral state on any boundary of the sample, however it is shaped. This example carves a circular disk out of the infinite lattice -- a boundary with no crystallographic meaning at all -- using build_finite_cluster&#x27;s keep predicate, and shows the in-gap states still hug that boundary in the topological phase, and fail to in the trivial one.">

.. only:: html

  .. image:: /api/gallery/condensed/topology/images/thumb/sphx_glr_plot_haldane_edge_state_map_thumb.png
    :alt:

  :doc:`/api/gallery/condensed/topology/plot_haldane_edge_state_map`

.. raw:: html

      <div class="sphx-glr-thumbnail-title">The Haldane Model: a Chiral Edge State on an Arbitrary Boundary</div>
    </div>


.. only:: not html

 * :doc:`/api/gallery/condensed/topology/plot_haldane_edge_state_map`

.. raw:: html

    <div class="sphx-glr-thumbcontainer" tooltip="Duncan Haldane showed that the integer quantum Hall effect does not require a net magnetic field at all. Threading complex second-neighbor hopping t_2 e^{i\phi} through a honeycomb lattice, in a pattern with zero net flux per unit cell but nonzero local (loop) curvature, produces a Chern insulator with C=\pm1 -- the first quantum anomalous Hall model, and the direct template for the \mathbb{Z}_2 topological insulators discovered two decades later. haldane_model gives the Bloch Hamiltonian used to track the bulk Chern number across the phase transition, and haldane_lattice_hamiltonian builds the same model in real space to expose the chiral edge states that bulk-boundary correspondence predicts.">

.. only:: html

  .. image:: /api/gallery/condensed/topology/images/thumb/sphx_glr_plot_haldane_phase_transition_thumb.png
    :alt:

  :doc:`/api/gallery/condensed/topology/plot_haldane_phase_transition`

.. raw:: html

      <div class="sphx-glr-thumbnail-title">The Haldane Model: A Chern Insulator with Zero Net Flux</div>
    </div>


